117400         MOVE P-LABOR-TOTAL TO LABOR-DOLLAR
117500         MOVE P-MATER-TOTAL TO MATER-DOLLAR
117600         MOVE P-PURCH-TOTAL TO PURCH-DOLLAR
117700         MOVE P-TOTAL-TOTAL TO TOTAL-DOLLAR
117800         MOVE P-ESTIM-TOTAL TO ESTIM-DOLLAR
               MOVE VALUE-LINE3 TO PRNTF-LINE
117900         WRITE PRNTF AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES
118000         MOVE SPACES TO PRNTF-LINE
118100         WRITE PRNTF AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES
118200         MOVE ALL "*" TO PRNTF-LINE
118300         WRITE PRNTF AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES
118400         MOVE 0 TO P-LABOR-TOTAL P-MATER-TOTAL P-PURCH-TOTAL
118500             P-TOTAL-TOTAL P-ESTIM-TOTAL
118600         IF END-OF-SORT-FILE
118700             MOVE SPACES TO PRNTF-LINE
118800             WRITE PRNTF AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES
118900            STRING "NOTE -  A '*' BESIDE A WORK ORDER INDICATES "
119000                "THAT THE WORK ORDER WAS CREATED AFTER THE "
