119200             DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO PRNTF-LINE
119300             WRITE PRNTF AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
119400
119600 8-NO-RECORDS.
119700     MOVE SPACES TO PRNTF-LINE.
119800     WRITE PRNTF AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE
119900     MOVE "NO RECORDS WERE FOUND THAT MATCHED THE RESTRICTIONS"
120000         TO PRNTF-LINE.
120100     WRITE PRNTF AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
120200     MOVE "PROGRAM TSUFFSUM" TO PRNTF-LINE.
120300     WRITE PRNTF AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
